 112: - [x] Evaluator — `public/js/editor/rule_engine/bonus-success-evaluator.js`. Pure function `resolveBonusSuccesses(c, rollContext)`. `rollContext = {attr, skill, disc, spec, rolledSuccesses}`. Returns `[{source, count}]` (empty if no rules fire or `rolledSuccesses === 0`).
 113: - [x] Roll-time helper — `resolveSuccesses(cols, c, rollContext)` in `shared/dice.js`. Returns `{rolled, bonus: [{source, count}], total}`.
 114: - [x] Cache extension — `load-rules.js` fetches `/api/rules/bonus_success`, exposes via `getRulesCache().rule_bonus_success`.
 115: - [x] Roll engine integration — replace `cntSuc(cols)` with `resolveSuccesses(cols, c, rollContext)` at every caller site listed in Code Map. Display the breakdown.
 116: - [x] Test harness — `server/tests/bonus-success.test.js`. Run every I/O Matrix row through the new evaluator. Snapshot character not mutated; deep-clone fixtures. Includes the Vigour-2 regression row (confirm `rule_disc_attr` still produces Vigour's Strength-dot contribution; this story does not touch it).
