  70: // ── SPEND ON ROLL (gdx.7, #988) ──
  71: //
  72: // Three pure functions, deliberately no DOM/globals, so the decision logic
  73: // is testable without a browser. `doRoll()` and `updPool()` each call all
  74: // three fresh, from the same state, rather than caching a combined verdict
  75: // — the label shown and the amount actually spent can never disagree,
  76: // because both are always the same computation.
