 140: /** Shared by updPool()'s label and doRoll()'s actual spend, so the two can
 141:  *  never disagree — both call this fresh rather than one caching for the
 142:  *  other. Reads the character CURRENTLY loaded into the roller
 143:  *  (`state.rollChar`); `trackerRead` is a synchronous cache read.
 144:  *
 145:  *  Review fix (Edge Case Hunter): the original comment here claimed
 146:  *  `trackerRead` was safe because `app.js`'s `_switchChar` always `await`s
 147:  *  `ensureTrackerLoaded` before `rollChar` is set — false. `app.js` sets
 148:  *  `suiteState.rollChar` at three sites; `pickChar()` (the roll tab's own
 149:  *  character picker — the most common path in play) and one sheet-view
