 156: ## Dev Agent Record
 157: 
 158: ### Implementation plan (as executed)
 159: 
 160: Red-green per task, in the story's own Execution order: schema, route/mounts, seed, evaluator,
 161: roll-time helper, cache extension, roll-engine integration, tests. The full test file was written
