 163: 
 164: ### Deviations from the Code Map, and why
 165: 
 166: The story was written 2026-04-30. Four of the seven dice surfaces it names **no longer exist**; this
 167: was verified against the working tree, not assumed:
 168: 
 169: | Story's Code Map entry | Reality on this branch |
 170: |---|---|
